  "content": "Project layout: everything Go lives under cmd/ - cmd/main.go (CLI entry, registered with Claude Code), cmd/app/ (Wails desktop app), cmd/internal/ (shared packages: ai, applog, config, memlog, scope, server, store). Tom explicitly asked for this on 2026-05-26 after the conventional `cmd/\u003cbinary\u003e/` + sibling `internal/` layout felt \"weird\". Tradeoff: `go install ./cmd` would name the binary \"cmd\", so `make install` uses `go build -o $(GOPATH)/bin/memorable-mcp ./cmd`. Go's internal/ visibility still works because cmd/internal/* is importable from anything under cmd/.",
  "tags": [
    "architecture",
    "layout",
    "preference"
  ],
